      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 4.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "so, hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.78,
      "end_seconds": 10.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.02,
      "end_seconds": 19.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "It's burning pain in the upper tummy. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.9,
      "end_seconds": 23.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "have you been feeling full quickly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.65,
      "end_seconds": 28.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "yeah. About a week, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.45,
      "end_seconds": 31.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "any mild nausea as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.15,
      "end_seconds": 41.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.47,
      "text": "yeah, that too. Uh, about mild nausea, about a six out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.71,
      "end_seconds": 50.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "Have you had burning pain in the upper tummy before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.36,
      "end_seconds": 61.45,
      "duration_seconds": 9.09,
      "text": "yeah, yes, something like this happened about six months ago, and it went away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.41,
      "end_seconds": 68.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "a few quick ones: vomiting blood, black stools or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.94,
      "end_seconds": 73.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.83,
      "end_seconds": 76.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Nothing like weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.71,
      "end_seconds": 81.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "no, uh, no weight loss"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.62,
      "end_seconds": 85.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.37,
      "end_seconds": 89.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.09,
      "end_seconds": 93.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.1,
      "end_seconds": 96.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.2,
      "end_seconds": 112.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.38,
      "end_seconds": 117.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.28,
      "end_seconds": 120.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.22,
      "end_seconds": 124.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.8,
      "end_seconds": 130.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.55,
      "end_seconds": 135.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Yeah, no allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.4,
      "end_seconds": 146.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.12,
      "end_seconds": 150.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "It's naproxen, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.08,
      "end_seconds": 154.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.39,
      "end_seconds": 160.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "It's 250 milligrams. Antacid. I take it when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.54,
      "end_seconds": 165.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.15,
      "end_seconds": 169.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "my brother has epilepsy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.07,
      "end_seconds": 174.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.81,
      "end_seconds": 185.71,
      "duration_seconds": 9.9,
      "text": "Right, I've had arthritis in my knees for five years now. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.5,
      "end_seconds": 196.77,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Okay, I can see arthritis in your knees in your file as well. Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.49,
      "end_seconds": 201.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "I had my tonsils removed as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.31,
      "end_seconds": 206.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.35,
      "end_seconds": 216.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.82,
      "end_seconds": 237.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 18, BP is 118 over 77, pulse 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.66,
      "end_seconds": 243.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.93,
      "end_seconds": 246.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.65,
      "end_seconds": 269.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "your tummy is soft with some tenderness in the upper middle part"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.74,
      "end_seconds": 275.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "you can sit up now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.02,
      "end_seconds": 322.52,
      "duration_seconds": 30.5,
      "text": "so, based on the history and the examination, I don't have a a clear answer today: dyspepsia possibly related to anti-inflammatory tablets is possible, and so is a stomach ulcer. I'll request blood tests, it'll help with dyspepsia. Let's book a test for the stomach germ to look into dyspepsia. I'm gonna put you on omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day, for four weeks. That should help with stomach acid"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.63,
      "end_seconds": 326.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "How soon will it work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.43,
      "end_seconds": 338.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "please stop taking the anti-inflammatory tablets for now and use paracetamol for the pain. Book a review in four weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.82,
      "end_seconds": 341.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Good, I'll return then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.16,
      "end_seconds": 347.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.14,
      "end_seconds": 359.5,
      "duration_seconds": 10.36,
      "text": "So, I take the omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day and come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.97,
      "end_seconds": 365.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.93,
      "end_seconds": 369.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "That's clear, um, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.28,
      "end_seconds": 372.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
